WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:05.281
Lab 2 needs a test tenant with Private
Access licenses, a connector group with

2
00:00:05.281 --> 00:00:10.513
two connectors on Windows Server 2019 or
later, a test server and a pilot group.

3
00:00:10.513 --> 00:00:14.815
Publish one app with the guide's
own requests, named so the kit's

4
00:00:14.815 --> 00:00:19.287
reviewed policy file finds it, one
host on 443, for the pilot group.

5
00:00:19.287 --> 00:00:23.270
Collect and check, comparing the
app read with the portal first;

6
00:00:23.270 --> 00:00:26.563
the policy check fails,
because there's no policy yet.

7
00:00:26.563 --> 00:00:29.450
Plan and apply its policy in report-only.

8
00:00:29.450 --> 00:00:33.413
Then validate: from a device
off the corporate network,

9
00:00:33.413 --> 00:00:37.112
the host is reachable on
443 and not on another port.

10
00:00:37.112 --> 00:00:40.637
Back it out by deleting the
policy, then the application.

11
00:00:40.637 --> 00:00:42.700
The authors haven't run this lab.
